<title>USA: Jay Jacobs July same store sales rise.</title>
<headline>Jay Jacobs July same store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jay Jacobs Inc said Tuesday sales for July were $4.74 million and comparable store sales increased 14 percent for the month.</p>
<p>For the second quarter ended August 1, comparable store sales increased 13 percent.  Total sales for the second quarter were $15.65 million.</p>
<p>Jay Jacobs is a specialty apparel retailer selling to men and women, operating 114 stores in 20 states.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
